B.aVH=new A.t("love","I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.aZp=new A.t("love","Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.b2U=new A.t("love","Deep riddle #3 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.b8i=new A.t("love","I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.b5J=new A.t("love","Challenge 5: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.b1o=new A.t("bible","Deep riddle #6 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I?","The great fish")
B.b4A=new A.t("bible","Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Noah's ark")
B.aVI=new A.t("bible","I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
B.b5u=new A.t("bible","Deep riddle #9 \u2014 Small in hand, giant on the field; one smooth stone ended my echo. What am I?","Goliath's challenge")
